<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories by Size — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Small MooLatté (Mocha)</strong></td><td>$4.29</td><td class="price-cell">~490 cal</td><td>~14g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Medium MooLatté</strong></td><td>$4.99</td><td class="price-cell">~660 cal</td><td>~19g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Large MooLatté</strong></td><td>$5.49</td><td class="price-cell">~870 cal</td><td>~25g</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Your local DQ may vary slightly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>What Is the DQ MooLatté?</h2>
  <p>The MooLatté® is DQ's frozen blended coffee drink — real coffee blended with DQ soft serve into a smooth, creamy frozen beverage. It sits between a Frappuccino and a milkshake in texture. Unlike the <a href="/items/chocolate-shake">standard DQ shake</a>, the MooLatté has a distinct coffee flavor that comes through the soft serve. It is available at DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. Find the full drinks lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>MooLatté Flavors Compared</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>MooLatté Flavor</th><th>Small Price</th><th>Approx. Cal</th><th>Profile</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Mocha</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.29</td><td>~490</td><td>Coffee + chocolate — most popular</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Caramel</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.29</td><td>~520</td><td>Coffee + sweet caramel — sweeter profile</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Vanilla</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$4.29</td><td>~470</td><td>Coffee + vanilla cream — lightest of the three</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>MooLatté vs. Starbucks Frappuccino — Value Comparison</h2>
  <p>A comparable Starbucks Frappuccino runs $6.00–$7.50 for a Grande. The DQ MooLatté at $4.29–$4.99 offers a similar frozen coffee experience at approximately 40% lower cost. The DQ version uses soft serve rather than a blended ice base, making it creamier than most frozen coffee drinks.</p>
  <h2>Related Drinks</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/chocolate-shake">DQ Chocolate Shake — from $3.49</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/drinks">Full DQ Drinks Menu</a></li>
  </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the DQ MooLatté?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Small $4.29, Medium $4.99, Large $5.49. 2026 national average prices.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What does the MooLatté taste like?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">A frozen, creamy coffee drink — similar to a Frappuccino. The Mocha has chocolate-coffee flavor, Caramel is sweeter, and Vanilla is the most subtle.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the MooLatté available at all DQ locations?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The MooLatté is available at DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations. Some DQ Treat-only locations may not carry it. Check your local DQ.</div></div>
      </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For the complete 2026 DQ food and treats menu, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
      See all Blizzard flavors on the <a href="/categories/blizzard-treats">Blizzard Treats</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

