    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>MooLatté</th><th>Small</th><th>Medium</th><th>Large</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Mocha (cal)</strong></td><td>~490</td><td>~660</td><td>~870</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Caramel (cal)</strong></td><td>~520</td><td>~700</td><td>~920</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Vanilla (cal)</strong></td><td>~470</td><td>~630</td><td>~840</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <h2>MooLatté Ordering Tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Best first order:</strong> Mocha Small — the coffee-chocolate combination is the most universally liked and gives you a clear baseline for future orders.</li>
      <li><strong>Lightest option:</strong> Vanilla Small at ~470 cal — the cleanest, most subtle coffee flavor.</li>
      <li><strong>Highest calorie:</strong> Caramel Large at ~920 cal — closest to a full meal in calories.</li>
      <li><strong>Whipped topping:</strong> Ask if your DQ adds whipped topping — some locations add it by default, others on request only.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Related DQ Drinks</h2>
